    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"inward\" thing... i don't know. it just feels like the fog is all there is. there's no \"new way,\" there's just the cliff. it feels like i've been walking in circles and now i'm just standing at the literal end of it. like the story just ran out of pages. it's so quiet here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
